{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792667352,"nonce":"C6KV7EKxgGz1o6XTPc8hnYj28gc=","message":"**Landed in 57d5a5a (with the engine in 3de6015 and the rows in e0749df)**\n\n`\u003ccode-diff\u003e` in components, built the way the plan above said: rows of one height, pooled, so no zones in CodeEditor.\n- Inline or side by side (a signal switches), two columns scrolling together; both line numbers in the gutter; changed words marked; unchanged runs folded to a row that opens when pressed, with `expandAll` and `collapseAll`.\n- API: `nextChange`, `previousChange`, `showChange`, `goToChange`, `reveal`, signals `changeCount`, `currentChange` and `comparing`; `navigation={true}` for a bar with \"2 of 5\" and buttons; F7 and Shift+F7.\n- Changes given as `hunks` are checked against the texts and used; otherwise the component compares, on the worker thread past 4,000 lines.\n- Stage and Revert are icon buttons that call hooks (`onStage`, `onRevert`), and `hunkActions` adds more; the icon buttons carry their label as a tooltip. ashui has no version-control logic; RayDE binds the hooks. The diff's own icons are plain strokes and replaceable through `icons`, because `ashui-components` must not depend on `ashui-icons` (the Remix licence).\n- Large files: no CodeDocument is made, lines are coloured as rows ask (CodeDiffText), and a line past 2,000 characters is cut. A 100,000-line pair with 300 edits went from 2,320 MB of footprint to 407 MB.\n- Theme: `--ui-diff-*` custom properties on the success and error tokens. Docs: docs/code-diff.md. Checks: CodeDiffEngine (31), CodeDiffRowsCheck (22), CodeDiffTextCheck (12) and CodeDiffComponent (44), which press the buttons with the pointer and check alignment. tools/snapshot/scenes/CodeDiffView.hx renders it.\n\n**Left, each on its own issue:** zone widgets in CodeEditor e23bd16 (item 2), deletion markers 96ae277 (item 3), minimap markers 118ce57 (item 4), an editable modified side 87bcc32, and reaching the hover-only buttons by keyboard a82a236. The three-way merge editor is not filed yet.","files":null}]}